{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20260C6TA94AU41793028111.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美股三大指數全線上升，道瓊斯工業平均指數早段曾升逾300點。</p><p></p><p>道指經過上周五急挫逾600點後，周一曾經反彈逾300點，重上52,500點水平。納斯達克指數亦向好，早段升逾100點，重上26,000點水平。晶片股造好，輝達、美光科技和閃迪升約百分之2至3。</p><p></p><p>計劃進行股本融資、集資最多950億美元的Meta，股價則跌約百分之1。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:07.709468+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T15:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T19:18:17.534023+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:13.695847+00:00","content_hash":"a0b851991b34e5b8e7e839c843d27d510c07986d68ff14bc5b900d88a2623506","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}